# One rule per line: label<TAB>regex. Matching ignores case. Read by no-push.ps1 and no-push.sh.
pushes with git	\bgit(\s+-\S+(\s+[^-\s]\S*)?)*\s+push\b
creates or merges on GitHub	\bgh\s+(pr\s+(create|merge)|release\s+create|repo\s+(create|sync))\b
publishes a package	\b(npm|pnpm|yarn|bun|cargo|poetry)\s+publish\b
pushes an image	\b(docker|podman)\s+push\b
uploads to PyPI	\btwine\s+upload\b
pushes to NuGet	\bnuget\s+push\b
